      <div class="pg-obs-feat"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 3.5l1.7 4.8 4.8 1.7-4.8 1.7L11 16.5l-1.7-4.8-4.8-1.7 4.8-1.7z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><path d="M18 15.5l.7 1.9 1.9.7-1.9.7-.7 1.9-.7-1.9-1.9-.7 1.9-.7z"/></svg></span><h3>Internal 3D Laser Engraving</h3><p>The character is etched inside the glass, point by point, so it seems to hover in mid-air and never scratches off.</p></div>
